# Conda Environment Rules

- Use `conda run -n gleb` for all package install commands.
- Use `conda run -n gleb pytest` for all test commands.
- Do not use bare `python`, `pip`, or `pytest` commands.
- Do not create `venv` or `virtualenv` environments in this project.
- Install this package in editable mode with `conda run -n gleb pip install -e .`.
- Set `BLENDER_PATH=/usr/bin/blender` when running test scenarios that invoke Blender.
